  "description": "Western Winter is a bold and rugged display font inspired by classic Wild West aesthetics. With strong slab serifs and a vintage-stamped texture, it captures the grit and charm of frontier design. Ideal for posters, signage, branding, and themed projects, this font adds a powerful, adventurous edge to any layout. Whether you're crafting a cowboy event flyer or a rustic logo, Western Winter brings authenticity and attitude. Perfect for designers seeking a creative display typeface with a western twist. Saddle up and let your typography ride bold with Western Winter.",
  "fullDescription": "<p><strong>Western Winter</strong> is a bold and rugged display font inspired by classic Wild West aesthetics. With strong slab serifs and a vintage-stamped texture, it captures the grit and charm of frontier design. Ideal for posters, signage, branding, and themed projects, this font adds a powerful, adventurous edge to any layout. Whether you're crafting a cowboy event flyer or a rustic logo, Western Winter brings authenticity and attitude. Perfect for designers seeking a creative display typeface with a western twist. Saddle up and let your typography ride bold with Western Winter.</p>",
